  "description": "Against all odds, a stray arrow sparks love.\n\nWhile hunting, young dragon Seolru mistakenly shoots a person. The unintended target is Ryun, Crown Prince of the Cloud Dragon Kingdom, who had been trapped in the area by the empress. Upon realizing that Seolru is not an assassin, Ryun takes her to his kingdom, where love is soon to blossom.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
